B.aPz=new A.bD(B.aQl,["Partial discharge in gas-filled cavities. Possible causes: gas bubbles in oil, voids in solid insulation, moisture ingress. Monitor H\u2082 levels closely.","Thermal fault below 300\xb0C. Possible causes: hotspot on core, overloaded conductors, bad contact joints, circulating currents in tank.","Thermal fault between 300\xb0C and 700\xb0C. Possible causes: severe overheating of conductors, faulty tap changer contacts, inter-laminar core faults.","Severe thermal fault above 700\xb0C. Possible causes: breakdown of conductor insulation, arc-induced heating, severe core fault. Immediate action required.","Low energy electrical discharge. Possible causes: partial discharge in oil, corona discharge, floating potential on metallic components.","High energy electrical discharge \u2014 ARC. Possible causes: arc between windings, breakdown of oil insulation, phase-to-phase or phase-to-earth fault.","Mixed thermal and electrical faults detected. Possible causes: combination of overheating and discharge activity. Further investigation with Roger's or IEC ratios recommended."],t.li)
